# Used instead of the root .dockerignore when building infra-batch/Dockerfile.
# Allowlist: only the npm manifests, src/ and the app's server code (for the
# scheduled reports job) go into the image. Everything else, in particular
# .env-aws, *.pem keys, Terraform state and the app's local data, stays out.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src/
!app/
app/data/
app/public/
